{"name":"Common Teal","hex":"#009193","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"common teal","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Synonym of Eurasian teal."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/common_teal"}],"entries":[{"title":"Eurasian teal","blocks":[{"text":"The Eurasian teal, common teal, or Eurasian green-winged teal is a common and widespread duck that breeds in temperate Eurosiberia and migrates south in winter. The Eurasian teal is often called simply the teal due to being the only one of these small dabbling ducks in much of its range. The bird gives its name to the blue-green colour teal."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/Eurasian_teal_%28Anas_crecca_crecca%29_male_Qingshui.jpg/330px-Eurasian_teal_%28Anas_crecca_crecca%29_male_Qingshui.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eurasian_teal","wikidata":"Q25700"},{"title":"Teal","blocks":[{"text":"Teal is a dark cyan color. Its name comes from that of a bird, the Eurasian teal which has a similarly colored stripe on its head. The word is often used colloquially to refer to shades of cyan in general."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Smithsonian_-_NMAAHC_-_Teal_blue_dress_and_cropped_jacket_designed_by_Ann_Lowe-_NMAAHC_2014.73.2.1-.2.jpg/330px-Smithsonian_-_NMAAHC_-_Teal_blue_dress_and_cropped_jacket_designed_by_Ann_Lowe-_NMAAHC_2014.73.2.1-.2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teal","wikidata":"Q1078214"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Common_Teal_%28Anas_crecca%29_near_Hodal%2C_Haryana_W_IMG_6512.jpg/330px-Common_Teal_%28Anas_crecca%29_near_Hodal%2C_Haryana_W_IMG_6512.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/Common_Teal_%28An